/P 44 0 R
/T (As an intern, being part of the Nallapadam campaign was a valuable learning experience. I had the opportunity to participate in the planning and implementation of the donation campaign. It was inspiring to see how people coming together can help those facing difficulties.)
/E (As an intern, being part of the Nallapadam campaign was a valuable learning experience. I had the opportunity to participate in the planning and implementation of the donation campaign. It was inspiring to see how people coming together can help those facing difficulties.)
/Pg 10 0 R
