58 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 44 0 R
/T (Three years ago, Arike Palliative Care launched a modest initiative, distributing school kits to just 20 children. The programme was born from a simple realisation that the impact of serious illness extends beyond the patient. Holistic palliative care must extend far beyond managing physical illnesses. When severe illness confines someone to a bed, the entire household bears a heavy psychological and financial burden. As families become overwhelmed by mounting medical expenses, children's educational needs are often overshadowed. )
/E (Three years ago, Arike Palliative Care launched a modest initiative, distributing school kits to just 20 children. The programme was born from a simple realisation that the impact of serious illness extends beyond the patient. Holistic palliative care must extend far beyond managing physical illnesses. When severe illness confines someone to a bed, the entire household bears a heavy psychological and financial burden. As families become overwhelmed by mounting medical expenses, children's educational needs are often overshadowed. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
59 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 44 0 R
/T (This year, that small effort evolved into Nallapaadam 3.0, standing as a powerful reminder of collective compassion. The project successfully supported 141 students with brand-new school bags, books, and stationery, bringing joy and confidence to their academic year. Overall, the initiative reached 73 patient families, providing vital relief and reducing psychosocial stress for at least 219 individuals, including patients and caregivers. Beyond the students, we intentionally purchased the kits' umbrellas directly from six artisans living with spinal cord injuries within our community, extending economic benefits and household stability to their families.)
/E (This year, that small effort evolved into Nallapaadam 3.0, standing as a powerful reminder of collective compassion. The project successfully supported 141 students with brand-new school bags, books, and stationery, bringing joy and confidence to their academic year. Overall, the initiative reached 73 patient families, providing vital relief and reducing psychosocial stress for at least 219 individuals, including patients and caregivers. Beyond the students, we intentionally purchased the kits' umbrellas directly from six artisans living with spinal cord injuries within our community, extending economic benefits and household stability to their families.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
