618 0 obj
<<
/Title (Three years ago, Arike Palliative Care launched a modest initiative, distributing school kits to just 20 children. The programme was born from a simple realisation that the impact of serious illness extends beyond the patient. Holistic palliative care must extend far beyond managing physical illnesses. When severe illness confines someone to a bed, the entire household bears a heavy psychological and financial burden. As families become overwhelmed by mounting medical expenses, children's educational needs are often overshadowed.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 564 0 R
/Next 666 0 R
>>
endobj
619 0 obj
<<
/Title (As we reflect on this incredible growth and begin envisioning Nallapaadam 4.0, our hope is to inspire local clubs, associations, and community groups to take up similar causes. Together, we can ensure that no child's education is compromised by their family's health battles.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 564 0 R
/Prev 667 0 R
>>
endobj
